---
import BlogPost from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<BlogPost title="Target Universities & Institutes"
  description="Universities offering direct tuition waivers and research lab stipends in Korea."
  pubDate={new Date()}
>
  <main class="container">
    <h1>Fully Funded Institutes in Korea</h1>
    <p>Explore institutes offering direct tuition waivers and lab stipends independent of GKS.</p>

    <div class="uni-grid">
      <div class="uni-card">
        <h2>GIST (Gwangju Inst. of Science & Tech)</h2>
        <p><strong>Funding:</strong> 100% Tuition Waiver + Monthly Stipend + Health Insurance</p>
        <p>Specialized STEM & AI graduate research institute.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="uni-card">
        <h2>KAIST</h2>
        <p><strong>Funding:</strong> KAIST International Scholarship (Full Tuition + Stipend)</p>
        <p>Korea's premier tech and engineering university in Daejeon.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BlogPost>